# ALLOWLIST build context (#202): the image is a public distribution, and a dev tree's root holds .membrane/ (the field, audit logs, tokens), field dumps and logs.
# Exclude everything, then re-include only what the image needs: the release tarballs and the entrypoint. Add a path here only if the image truly needs it, never a root wildcard.
*
!docker-dist/*.tar.gz
!docker/docker-entrypoint.sh
